                    "Musinsky on how the brand opens: \"For the most part, we go in with the offer asking for everything because we know we can start scaling back.  If we're looking for an Instagram post or TikTok, we'll ask for syndication so that it's posted across both platforms or even three platforms that will include YouTube Shorts.\"  On usage, she says the brand normally asks for two weeks of paid usage, paid in advance, meaning the right to run the creator's post as an advert from the brand's own account.  So the opening ask is deliberately maximal and is expected to shrink.",
